{"id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-expressive-completeness.md","title":"表达完备性","display":"df-expressive-completeness — 表达完备性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-expressive-completeness","aliases":["91-df-expressive-completeness","91-df-expressive"],"display":"df-expressive-completeness — 表达完备性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-ground-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-expressive-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-expressive-completeness</span><span>91-df-expressive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-expressive-completeness — 表达完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"253f996295270684\" href=\"?note=253f996295270684\" title=\"91-df-ground-model\">91-df-ground-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-expressive-completeness-—-表达完备性-$\\mathrm{ExpComp}$\">df-expressive-completeness — 表达完备性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExpComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExpComp}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0\\)</span> (基础语言结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_T\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0\">\\(\\mathfrak M_T\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0\\)</span> (基础结构的真理扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathfrak M_T}\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M_0|\">\\(T^{\\mathfrak M_T}\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M_0|\\)</span> (真理谓词在扩张中的外延)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\land\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\varphi\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\land\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\varphi\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak M_T)\\coloneqq\nT^{\\mathfrak M_T}=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak M_T)\\coloneqq\nT^{\\mathfrak M_T}=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等价地，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_T\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_T\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExpComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExpComp}\\)</span> : 表达完备性（expressive completeness）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\)</span>：在基础结构中成立的全部基础语言句子的编码集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>表达完备性的含义：\n这里的表达增益是：一个谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(x)\">\\(T(x)\\)</span> 统一定义全部基础语言真句的编码集。每个具体算术公式本来就已能表达其自身性质，不能据此写出原定义中任意的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\psi\">\\(\\exists\\psi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>表达完备性的具体内容：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>原公式</th>\n<th>真理表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>单个基础句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td>已由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 表达</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 统一按编码访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全部基础真句</td>\n<td>不由单个算术公式定义</td>\n<td>在适当扩张中由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(x)\">\\(T(x)\\)</span> 定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>表达完备性的证明：\n验证表达完备性应检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的外延是否恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\)</span>，或对象理论是否对每个基础句证明正确的 T-双条件；不能把“若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 真”当作形式推导步骤。</p>\n<p>表达完备性的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对标准算术真集而言，正确的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 不属于任何固定的算术复杂度层级</li>\n<li>这一结论涉及统一真集，而不是说每个含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公式都比每个算术公式更强</li>\n<li>这是真理谓词的核心优势</li>\n</ul>\n<p>表达完备性与不可定义性：\n表达完备性不与Tarski定理矛盾：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>表达完备性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>能&quot;表达&quot;算术性质</li>\n<li>不可定义性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>本身不能在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span>中定义\n两者不同：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>表达其他性质，但不能定义自己。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>表达完备性在真理理论中的应用：\n真理理论利用表达完备性证明更多定理：\n具体理论能否借助 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 还取决于组合公理、归纳和反思原则，不能由表达性定义直接推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-expressive-completeness-—-表达完备性-$\\mathrm{ExpComp}$","text":"df-expressive-completeness — 表达完备性 $\\mathrm{ExpComp}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-model","status":"resolved","id":"253f996295270684","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExpComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_T\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathfrak M_T}\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M_0|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\land\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\varphi\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak M_T)\\coloneqq\nT^{\\mathfrak M_T}=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0},","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_T\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExpComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}","display":false},{"tex":"T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak M_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":2943,"backlinks":[{"id":"f088119b0602bcd0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-composition